### ==================== 用户资料修改测试 ====================
# 测试修改用户名、修改手机号功能

### ==================== 变量 ====================
@token = REPLACE_ME_请粘贴登录token


### ==================== 修改用户名 ====================

### 1. 正常修改用户名
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changeUserName
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

newName=新用户名测试


### 2. 修改用户名 — 长度为 50（边界值，应该成功）
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changeUserName
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

newName=AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA


### 3. 修改用户名 — 长度超过 50（应该失败）
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changeUserName
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

newName=AAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAAA


### 4. 修改用户名 — 名称为空字符串
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changeUserName
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

newName=


### 5. 修改用户名 — 缺少 newName 参数
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changeUserName
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded


### 6. 修改用户名 — 未登录
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changeUserName
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

newName=未登录修改


### 7. 修改用户名 — 伪造 token
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changeUserName
token: fake-token-12345
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

newName=伪造token修改


### ==================== 修改手机号 ====================

### 8. 正常修改手机号
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePhone
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

oldPhone=13800138000&newPhone=13900139000


### 9. 修改手机号 — 旧手机号不匹配
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePhone
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

oldPhone=13800000000&newPhone=13900139001


### 10. 修改手机号 — 新手机号格式错误（太短）
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePhone
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

oldPhone=13800138000&newPhone=123


### 11. 修改手机号 — 新手机号格式错误（非数字）
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePhone
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

oldPhone=13800138000&newPhone=abcdefghijk


### 12. 修改手机号 — 新旧手机号相同
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePhone
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

oldPhone=13800138000&newPhone=13800138000


### 13. 修改手机号 — 新手机号已被其他用户使用
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePhone
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

oldPhone=13800138000&newPhone=10000000001


### 14. 修改手机号 — 缺少 oldPhone
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePhone
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

newPhone=13900139002


### 15. 修改手机号 — 缺少 newPhone
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePhone
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

oldPhone=13800138000


### 16. 修改手机号 — 未登录
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePhone
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

oldPhone=13800138000&newPhone=13900139003


### ==================== 修改密码 ====================

### 17. 正常修改密码
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePassword
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "phone": "13800138000",
    "oldPassword": "123",
    "newPassword": "456"
}


### 18. 修改密码 — 旧密码错误
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePassword
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "phone": "13800138000",
    "oldPassword": "wrongpassword",
    "newPassword": "456"
}


### 19. 修改密码 — 手机号不匹配
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePassword
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "phone": "13800000000",
    "oldPassword": "123",
    "newPassword": "456"
}


### 20. 修改密码 — 缺少 phone
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePassword
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "oldPassword": "123",
    "newPassword": "456"
}


### 21. 修改密码 — 缺少 oldPassword
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePassword
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "phone": "13800138000",
    "newPassword": "456"
}


### 22. 修改密码 — 缺少 newPassword
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePassword
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "phone": "13800138000",
    "oldPassword": "123"
}


### 23. 修改密码 — 未登录
POST http://localhost:8080/user/changePassword
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "phone": "13800138000",
    "oldPassword": "123",
    "newPassword": "456"
}
